## 3. The repairs
* **R1** -- the block is now between `CC=$(command -v cc || command -v gcc)` and `need_file "$HERE/diff_ieee_store.c"`.
  It is invoked as `GEN= TABLE= CC="$CC" "$HERE/diff_m88k_loadstore_gen.sh" > "$MLSLOG" 2>&1`.  Its comment gains the
