`gate_skip` exits (`lib.sh:137-144`). With no compiler the new block is not reached. With a compiler it runs before the unconfigured-tree skip at `gate_offline.sh:241`. A missing or broken generator still prints `ROWS=123` and `M88KLS_DONE` and fails `gen_compiles` (the nocompiler and `CC=/bin/false` receipts: `FAIL=64`).

